ARCHITECTURE DIRECTORY (tam-file)

This folder is for architecture notes. It documents the data structures
and algorithms of the reference implementations tracked in ideas/ (as well
as how tam-file plans to implement or adapt them under the Tamlinux
philosophy: pure C11, minimal dependencies, libtam-only linkage, and
first-class Linux virtual console support).

Contents:

- yazi.md : Data structures and algorithms observed in Yazi (/home/fred/Code/yazi)
            and how tam-file plans to adapt them in C11/libtam.
